**Cleaning Decisions:**  
Data-cleaning methods were selected according to the characteristics of the dataset to improve data quality and support reliable analysis.

## 6. Analysis and Insights

The project aims to explore sales performance, compare product or category sales, calculate statistical summaries, and identify patterns in the available data. The final insights depend on the results obtained from the actual dataset.

